  "referenceNumber": "RUS3068",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that Narmina DADASHOVA is an involved person on the basis of the following grounds: (1) Narmina DADASHOVA is or has been involved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, by owning or controlling directly or indirectly, or working as a director, trustee, or other manager or equivalent of ALT CAPITAL PTE LTD, an entity that is or has been providing financial services, or making available funds, economic resources, goods or technology, that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine; \n (2) Narmina DADASHOVA has also been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia through working as a manager of an entity (Mechel Carbon Pte Ltd) carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian extractives sector.\n",
